  "details": "Set the camera to stream mode, turn on Spout, turn on camera audio, and fix the camera position to the world.\n\nPreviously, even if you closed the camera and moved, the audio would remain from the fixed camera position.\n\nHowever, the moment you closed the camera, the audio would switch to your own position and direction.\n\nThis works fine as long as you keep the camera control screen open.\n\nBuild: 1769 (Live version)",
